  "utterances": [
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 2.43,
      "text": "Tarnhollow Builders, this is Marisol."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 3.19,
      "end": 6.48,
      "text": "Hi Marisol, Sam from Vantrellis. Okay, let's get started."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 6.86,
      "end": 7.22,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 7.59,
      "end": 12.73,
      "text": "Today I'll walk you through how we work and then show you the product."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 13.62,
      "end": 13.99,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 14.66,
      "end": 21.27,
      "text": "Most teams we talk to struggle with crew scheduling, so let me show you how we fix that."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 22.08,
      "end": 23.28,
      "text": "Okay, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 24.27,
      "end": 26.07,
      "text": "Is that costing you much?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 27.08,
      "end": 29.53,
      "text": "Some, I'd guess. Hard to say."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 30.62,
      "end": 34.65,
      "text": "What are you hoping a new tool would do for you?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 35.05,
      "end": 37.08,
      "text": "Just make it easier, really."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 37.58,
      "end": 46.79,
      "text": "Our platform helps teams like yours schedule faster and keep everyone updated. It has mobile alerts, reporting, and integrations with the tools you already use."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 47.36,
      "end": 51.48,
      "text": "Right, and the thing that worries me is whether my"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 51.85,
      "end": 55.5,
      "text": "Right, right, so that's exactly what our dispatch module handles."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 56.23,
      "end": 59.1,
      "text": "Okay. What does something like that cost?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 59.92,
      "end": 66.16,
      "text": "It depends on a lot of things. Let's talk about that once we know it's a fit."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 66.74,
      "end": 67.94,
      "text": "Sure, I guess."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 68.56,
      "end": 75.18,
      "text": "Who else weighs in on a decision like this, and how have you bought software like this before?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 76.03,
      "end": 85.56,
      "text": "I'd bring in Dana, our COO. Dana signs anything over ten thousand. Last time it took about a month with a trial first."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 86.59,
      "end": 92.84,
      "text": "So a trial, then Dana, about a month. Is there a date you'd want this live by?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 93.94,
      "end": 96.39,
      "text": "Before the busy season, so November."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 96.92,
      "end": 100.94,
      "text": "Does what you've seen so far make sense for your team?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 101.94,
      "end": 106.89,
      "text": "Can you just send me some info and I'll look it over?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 107.43,
      "end": 113.31,
      "text": "Well, honestly, the info won't show you much. We're actually cheaper than most of the market."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 114.29,
      "end": 115.91,
      "text": "Okay. Send it anyway."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 116.54,
      "end": 125.01,
      "text": "Can we put thirty minutes on the calendar with Dana for Thursday at ten, so you both see it running with your tools?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 125.7,
      "end": 129.81,
      "text": "Thursday at ten works. I'll forward the invite to Dana."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 130.78,
      "end": 132.95,
      "text": "Thanks Marisol, really appreciate the time."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 133.31,
      "end": 134.1,
      "text": "Thanks, bye."
    }
  ],
